@node Overview
@chapter Overview
@cindex overview

notciv is a server-client game.  It is in pre-alpha development, so do not
expect it to be playable for a while.

@node Invoking
@chapter Invoking notciv
@cindex invoking
@cindex options
@cindex command-line arguments

The server takes the following options.  Diagnostic messages go to standard
error; standard output is reserved for the server console.

@table @option
@item -h
@itemx --help
Print a short pointer to this manual and exit.

@item --version
Print the development status of notciv and exit.

@item --loud
Also print informational messages, such as progress during startup.

@item --quiet
Suppress warnings, such as those about unrecognized arguments.  Errors are
always printed.
@end table

